  "findings": [
    "Five supported drafts failed with provider invalid_reply; three were classified unsupported; one passed local oracle and Bot review but compile failed because the isolated state lacked tmp/cache directories.",
    "The xAI Console log for pier-drawers shows a completed response with 900 completion tokens. Its outer JSON is valid, but planJson is malformed at character 1777 because an extra closing brace follows a nested rule. The other four invalid_reply bodies have not been inspected. The protected raw log is outside the repository.",
    "The ambiguous brief was classified unsupported instead of asking for the two required clarifications.",
    "A separate direct compile of the same ninth-case plan succeeded after creating tmp/cache. The ninth-case attempt remains failed; no operator repair was counted as a pass.",
    "The original HTTPS Bot callback ingress was restored; the pilot container was stopped and its state retained."
  ],
  "limits": "The Bot account meter is rounded to cents and shared. The exact per-review Bot charge is unavailable. No unsupported public production authoring claim follows from this sample."
